史殷道鸞未之郡，以為諮議參軍。以弟遯為冠軍、竟陵內史，總留任，兄子世猷為建威將軍、南平太守。劉粹若至，周超能破之者，即以為龍驤將軍、雍州刺史。晦率眾二萬，發自江陵，舟艦列自江津至于破冢，旍旂相照，蔽奪日光。晦乃歎曰：「恨不得以此為勤王之師！」自領湘州刺史，以張邵為輔國將軍，邵不受命。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p016:m0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"蕭摹之","person_id":"sxm_uv1_fvi","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p016:m0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"劉道產","person_id":"nkg_gf7_8tm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p016:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"晦","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p016:u0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"其","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"前文蕭摹之、劉道產兩人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p016:m0044","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"殷道鸞","person_id":"mj8_5ic_4kk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p016:m0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"遯","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AAAF","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p016:m0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"世猷","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AAA*B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p016:m0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"劉粹","person_id":"921_112_227","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p016:m0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"周超","person_id":"nq6_sxq_puj","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretatio